{"content_hash": "ff7d5f7fd4c60d32", "version_id": 1032, "article_id": 104, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Apple changes its leaders and launches new products in 2026", "title_zh": "苹果2026年换了掌门人，还发了一堆新品", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119191", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621768216002-5ac171876625?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8YXBwbGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NTIyODc3OHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Sumudu Mohottige on Unsplash", "author": "Sumudu Mohottige", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@stm_2790?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/apple-logo-on-metallic-surface-bIgpii04UIg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "787389163722"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-21", "word_count": 158, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "Apple had a big year in 2026. It launched new products and got a new CEO. A Chinese tech site now asks readers to score the company.", "lead_zh": "苹果在2026年动作不小，既发了新品，也换了新掌门人。国内一家科技媒体现在请读者来给苹果打分。", "preview": "Apple launched many new devices in 2026. The cheap MacBook Neo uses an A series chip. The new MacBook Pro has an OLED touch screen for the f", "preview_zh": "苹果在2026年推出了很多新设备。便宜的MacBook Neo使用A系列芯片。新款MacBook Pro首次用上OLED触控屏。iPhone 18 Pro只有小幅升级，折叠屏的iPhone Duo也来了。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1015, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 55.25, "size_bytes": 332496, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 179, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_a2