an score Apple from today until January 3, 2027. They must have an account for 30 days. They rate nine areas and see other users' scores. Fifteen people with good comments will win gifts."], "paragraphs_zh": ["苹果在2026年推出了很多新设备。便宜的MacBook Neo使用A系列芯片。新款MacBook Pro首次用上OLED触控屏。iPhone 18 Pro只有小幅升级，折叠屏的iPhone Duo也来了。", "Tim Cook执掌苹果15年，今年把位子交给了John Ternus。新的Siri AI能理解个人情境，还能跨应用操作。不过它还在测试，在中国的上线也晚了。", "因为反垄断规定，App Store的收入增速慢了下来。硬件利润也承压。所以大家都在问，苹果下一步靠什么增长。少数派从2021年起已经办过五次苹果评分活动。", "今年，用户可以从今天到2027年1月3日给苹果打分。账号要注册满30天。大家给九个方面评分，还能看到别人的分数。评语写得好的15个人会拿到礼品。"], "body": "Apple launched many new devices in 2026. The cheap MacBook Neo uses an A series chip. The new MacBook Pro has an OLED touch screen for the first time. The iPhone 18 Pro got small upgrades, and the folding iPhone Duo arrived.\n\nTim Cook led Apple for 15 years. He passed the job to John Ternus this year. The new Siri AI can understand personal situations and work across apps. It is still in testing, and it is late in China.\n\nThe App Store now makes less money because of antitrust rules. Hardware profits are also under pressure. So people are asking what will drive Apple's growth next. The site SSPAI has run an Apple score survey five times since 2021.\n\nThis year, users can score Apple from today until January 3, 2027. They must have an account for 30 days. They rate nine areas and see other users' scores. Fifteen people with good comments will win gifts.", "body_zh": "苹果在2026年推出了很多新设备。便宜的MacBook Neo使用A系列芯片。新款MacBook Pro首次用上OLED触控屏。iPhone 18 Pro只有小幅升级，折叠屏的iPhone Duo也来了。\n\nTim Cook执掌苹果15年，今年把位子交给了John Ternus。新的Siri AI能理解个人情境，还能跨应用操作。不过它还在测试，在中国的上线也晚了。\n\n因为反垄断规定，App Store的收入增速慢了下来。硬件利润也承压。所以大家都在问，苹果下一步靠什么增长。少数派从2021年起已经办过五次苹果评分活动。\n\n今年，用户可以从今天到2027年1月3日给苹果打分。账号要注册满30天。大家给九个方面评分，还能看到别人的分数。评语写得好的15个人会拿到礼品。", "text": "Apple launched many new devices in 2026. The cheap MacBook Neo uses an A series chip. The new MacBook Pro has an OLED touch screen for the first time. The iPhone 18 Pro got small upgrades, and the 